Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

Heeeey Bruce, 

You're In!!! Welcome and thanks for signing up for Dispute 21. I'm so
glad that you're here and I look forward to educating you over the next
21 days.

As a credit repair business owner and a mentor and coach to over 100
credit repair specialists and processors, I get asked tons of questions
every day and receive even more in my email and inbox weekly regarding
the newest dispute tactics, credit education and best practices in
processing clients. So, I decided to take the most frequently asked
questions about credit and disputing, create content around them and put
it together in a detailed but easy to understand course delivered right
to your email. I specifically designed Dispute 21 for both new and
seasoned credit repair business owners and their processing staff. Since
everyone can't get me on the phone for a one-on-one coaching session or
book me for a VIP Intensive, I wanted to ensure there was an affordable
way to get you answers to the burning questions you have that just
aren't being answered in a Google Search or these Social Media Groups.

Starting off, the flow of the content may seem a bit out of place,
especially if you're anticipating receiving that "perfect" dispute flow
to take every client through from start to finish. Spoiler Alert...that
is not the sole focus of this course. But trust me on this; if you stick
with it and consume and study the content I'll be dripping to you over
the next month, by the time you complete Dispute 21 you will have gotten
everything you're expecting and more.     

During this 21 Day Credit Dispute, Education and Informational Course
You Will:

* Gain an understanding of the laws that regulate the credit repair
industry, such as the FCRA, FDCPA, FACTA, FCBA, Statute of Limitations,
etc.

* Gain a clear understanding of the Debt Validation Process and ways to
Defeat Debt Collectors to help Remove Stubborn Collection Items off the
credit report.

* Learn easy to follow dispute strategy flows to make your dispute
process seamless and save you time on processing client files because
you'll now have the knowledge to create an action plan that quickly
helps you determine your next move.

* Study Case Law, terminology and other important concepts to gain a
clear understanding of the dispute process and the "why" behind your
actions.

* Learn Advanced Dispute Methods and resources for disputing items, such
as Charge-offs, Bankruptcies, and Auto Repossessions 

+ So Much More...

In Dispute 21 you will receive emails everyday until the end. And since
I'm all about Over Delivering, the end very well may have an additional
5, 6, 7+ days added to it. Because I absolutely love me some freebies,
I've added some additional bonus content to ensure that you are out here
kicking butt, like a certified Dispute Ninja! More importantly, the
content I've selected and created for this course was done so to ensure
that you walk away confident in your craft and ability to educate the
client and the public on credit, credit repair and how you can help them
so that you become the go to expert and are equipped to CLOSE the Client
every time.

Bruce, some email service providers still don't understand how
awesome we are and how important our work is, so they tend to try and
get in the way of our greatness. I would hate to have you miss out on
this information, so to prevent your emails from going to spam, please
add support@educreditsolutions.com to your address book. 

The course beings NOW...So gear up, grab your pen and paper, get your
cape strapped on tight and get ready to Supercharge those Super Powers
Credit Hero!

Warmly, 

 

